  "content": "<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uniS9UM.png\" width=\"1127\" height=\"276\" alt=\"夜光\">\n<center>\n\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/52LU4mv.png\" width=\"86\" height=\"23\" alt=\"關於\">\n\n本模組將為您的遊戲添加各種新的裝飾性光源，從仙女燈到小夜燈！<br><br><span>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/a_4T-7BOqCY\" title=\"YouTube 影片播放器\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<div>\n    <p><br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><br>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mnnbI3S.png\" alt=\"製作團隊\">\n\nJosh/Joosh - 美術設計<br>flechazo098 - 程式編寫<br>samgj15 - 程式編寫\n    <p><br></p>  \n\n**<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZtjUq8p.png\" alt=\"我們的其他作品\">**\n\n[**苦力怕大翻新**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/creeper-overhaul) 一個徹底改造原版苦力怕的模組！<br>\n[**生物與野獸**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/creatures-and-beasts) 一個為 Minecraft 加入精彩生物的模組！<br>\n[**幽靈**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/ghost) 一個在你的世界中加入兩種友善幽靈生物的模組！<br>\n[**鐵魔像大翻新**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/golem-overhaul) 一個新增 9 種鐵魔像種類的模組！<br>\n[**終界使者大翻新**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/enderman-overhaul) 一個徹底改造原版終界使者的模組！<br>\n[**小動物與夥伴**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/critters-and-companions) 一個加入各種友善動物的模組！<br>\n[**銳利無比**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/lookin-sharp) 為遊戲新增 60 種近戰武器！<br>\n[**蛙鳴**](https://www.modrinth.com/mod/ribbits) 蛙鳴加入了新的沼澤村莊，充滿了青蛙村民！\n<div>\n    <p><br></p>\n        <a href=\"https://discord.gg/sGwxnFV\">\n            <img width=\"10%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T4ltmGW.png\" alt=\"Discord\">\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Joosh7889\">\n            <img width=\"10%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ewzK3Zb.png\" alt=\"Twitter\">\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUvb1-kBGDEA1gVtd3UhlLg/videos\">\n            <img width=\"10%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EirVdtZ.png\" alt=\"YouTube\">\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/bonsaistudios\">\n